{"items":[{"id":"1553816203826782209","title":"破7了","content":"<p>破7了</p>","excerpt":"破7了","voteupCount":95,"commentCount":39,"created":1663238651,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1553816203826782209"},{"id":"1553349740632469504","title":"问大家一个问题，大家想让我就把这个需求…","content":"<p>问大家一个问题，大家想让我就把这个需求端的给写写细节呢，还是去写县城人口3年少了10w呢?&lt;br&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zhihu.com/question/553449331/answer/2672667670?utm_source=zhihu&quot; class=&quot;internal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;美股暴跌纳指跌超 5� CPI 诱发对美联储暴力加息恐慌，标普创两年多最大跌幅，反映了哪些问题？&lt;/a&gt;</p>","excerpt":"问大家一个问题，大家想让我就把这个需求…","voteupCount":70,"commentCount":33,"created":1663127438,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1553349740632469504"},{"id":"1553100654721257472","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-71721e099f7a80435283441b702ba325_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1192\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":167,"commentCount":44,"created":1663068051,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1553100654721257472"},{"id":"1553006183677648896","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-7159ea4b97c457a58808bee99f9ee371_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"772\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":87,"commentCount":21,"created":1663045527,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1553006183677648896"},{"id":"1552228018235576320","title":"就是什么吧","content":"<p>就是什么吧。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;知乎我会写的短点，尽量亮观点，因为我观察过了，知乎只要一长的话（超过五百字）观众就不爱看了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;所以我会选比较大家比较关心的话题把细节给补充到位发公众号，所以大家如果想看长一点细节一点的还是关注一下公众号会好点。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;当然，公众号也不会太长（2500以内），毕竟现在似乎大家已经不怎么爱看长文了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5BmEoUO_OGo5m29pqO5Vrg&quot; class=&quot; wrap external&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;链接&lt;/a&gt;</p>","excerpt":"就是什么吧","voteupCount":98,"commentCount":26,"created":1662859998,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1552228018235576320"},{"id":"1551965468772212736","title":"房地产从没有绑架经济 他绑架只是某些群…","content":"<p>房地产从没有绑架经济&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;他绑架只是某些群体的工资。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zhihu.com/question/552640874/answer/2667936925?utm_source=zhihu&quot; class=&quot;internal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;兰州公交集团负债39亿让员工贷款发工资，如何看待这一现象？&lt;/a&gt;</p>","excerpt":"房地产从没有绑架经济 他绑架只是某些群…","voteupCount":129,"commentCount":2,"created":1662797401,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1551965468772212736"},{"id":"1551879620085047296","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-f40c5d335cfbdf0b3eb5a9875520ad3d_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1002\" height=\"1081\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":183,"commentCount":7,"created":1662776933,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1551879620085047296"},{"id":"1551513825463185408","title":"…这不是p的吧…","content":"<p>…这不是p的吧…</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-f7799046b52c12d46153843eca14a313_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1382\">","excerpt":"…这不是p的吧…","voteupCount":130,"commentCount":20,"created":1662689721,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1551513825463185408"},{"id":"1550809630028357632","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-9d9867efe8a370f7b9ce55bfe77241b8_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"838\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":150,"commentCount":23,"created":1662521828,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1550809630028357632"},{"id":"1550431917887160320","title":"以前答应大家搞个百万实盘的，就先放这吧…","content":"<p>以前答应大家搞个百万实盘的，就先放这吧，以后公众号会当个保留节目，慢慢把这些资金投出去。</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-ad02caf61dcca1ba4d10a41380084d25_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"